# A draft module the umbrella deliberately does not import.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.test/onto/core#> .

<https://example.test/onto/draft> a owl:Ontology ; owl:imports <https://example.test/onto/core> .

ex:DraftOnly a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "draft only"@en .
